ments, and system activity logs.\n4. **Policy & Recreation Risk Evaluation**:\n   - Applies [`deletion_rules.csv`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/dataset/deletion_rules.csv) to detect lingering records, exposed PII, active sync data flows (`REPORT_ACTIVE_DATA_FLOW`), and restore risks (`REPORT_RESTORE_RISK`).\n5. **Canonical Step Synthesis & Ordering**:\n   - Enforces strict phase ordering (`FINDING` $\\to$ `REMEDIATION` $\\to$ `VERIFICATION`), operation priority, and system/resource ID sorting with exact schema validation.\n6. **Evaluation Reports & Packaging**:\n   - Automatically generates the required `code/evaluation/evaluation_report.md` and `code/evaluation/usage_report.md` and packages the final clean submission.\n\nCheck out the full roadmap in [`plan.md`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/plan.md). Whenever you are ready, we can kick off Phase 1 (validating our logic against all 32 ground-truth sample cases)!"}
